  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Peace in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the Peace Process by supporting the work of Peace Promoters. It seeks to facilitate the necessary conditions for the development of a work plan, within the framework of the legal and political provisions approved by the OACP (High Commissioner for Peace Office). In such way, support will be provided to the strengthening and implementation of Peace, Coexistence and Reconciliation Public Policy</narrative>
  </description>
